{"2838890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mithrall", "steam_appid": 2838890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=616 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Legend in a Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vast, ever-evolving realm where survival, conquest, and creativity collide. Every player shapes the world — whether you build towering fortresses, wage epic battles, or carve out hidden kingdoms beneath the earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way – No Classes, Just Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield any weapon, wear any gear, and define your own playstyle. Swap between heavy armor and massive hammers, swift blades and leather gear, or ranged magic with flowing robes — your equipment determines your abilities, not a preset class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World to Discover and Shape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through endless landscapes — from towering mountains to deep underground caverns. Build above ground to display your might, or hide your fortress beneath the earth to guard your treasures. Exploration isn’t just encouraged — it’s essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Land. Rule It. Tax It.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your walls, fortify your defenses, and upgrade your structures. Claim territory across servers, control vital resources, and set taxes to fund your conquests. Land is power — and power is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d3e66a56d5ff2ca3d15f730afd4d156e.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mount Up for Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From swift warhorses to sturdy pack beasts, ground mounts offer speed, strength, and utility. Take to the skies with majestic flying mounts to scout enemy lines or reach hidden lands beyond mortal reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/04cbe2a67282b76a5108a787b7761633.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/78b8770c7a14c7a62ad47925387ab1ed.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battlefields of Glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join massive, skill-based battles where weapon choice defines your abilities. From siege warfare to small skirmishes, your tactics — and your gear — decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/3de149c2fd8dfbea0a200553f2e5adeb.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame Beasts. Face Titans.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with friends, tame exotic creatures, and venture into the wild. Brave ancient dungeons and challenge towering bosses in encounters where teamwork and preparation are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"b