our story is yours to forge. The realm awaits.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=616 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Legend in a Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vast, ever-evolving realm where survival, conquest, and creativity collide. Every player shapes the world — whether you build towering fortresses, wage epic battles, or carve out hidden kingdoms beneath the earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/8149f044e289f818e6d653de8de8b7d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way – No Classes, Just Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield any weapon, wear any gear, and define your own playstyle. Swap between heavy armor and massive hammers, swift blades and leather gear, or ranged magic with flowing robes — your equipment determines your abilities, not a preset class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/948572425ea936578013d914ae3cf4d2.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World to Discover and Shape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through endless landscapes — from towering mountains to deep underground caverns. Build above ground to display your might, or hide your fortress beneath the earth to guard your treasures. Exploration isn’t just encouraged — it’s essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.poster.avif?t=1781544879\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.webm?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/64e3b072d0abccda09d44bd15d5684eb.mp4?t=1781544879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Land. Rule It. Tax It.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your walls, fortify your defenses, and upgrade your structures. Claim territory across servers, control